OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween festival cancelled by
OL,4,Astorm after one night of macabre mayhem
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorm forecasts have led to the
OL,7,Fcancellation of festivities in
OL,8,F"Scotland's Halloween capital" this
OL,9,Fweekend.
OL,11,FThe annual event in Paisley,
OL,12,FRenfrewshire went ahead on Friday with
OL,13,Fmore than 400 performers, but the
OL,14,FSaturday festivities have been called
OL,15,Foff.
OL,17,FOrganisers at Renfrewshire Council said
OL,18,Fthey were "very sorry" and tickets for
OL,19,Fgrandstand seating would be refunded.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
